[{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":30,"col":30},"end":{"line":30,"col":38}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` is inside a type.\n\nA word describes a whole parameter or the whole result, so it stands in front\nof a parameter of the signature's arrow or in front of its result:\n`join : borrowed List String, String → String`. Move it there, or remove it."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":33,"col":24},"end":{"line":33,"col":29}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `fresh` is inside a type.\n\nA word describes a whole parameter or the whole result, so it stands in front\nof a parameter of the signature's arrow or in front of its result:\n`join : borrowed List String, String → String`. Move it there, or remove it."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":36,"col":26},"end":{"line":36,"col":30}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`once` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":39,"col":25},"end":{"line":39,"col":29}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`many` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":42,"col":25},"end":{"line":42,"col":30}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`fresh` describes a result, and this is a parameter.\n\n`fresh`, `exclusive` and `unknown` say what a call returns, so they stand in\nfront of the type after the last `→`. A parameter takes `unused`, `borrowed`,\n`aliased`, `returned`, `escaped` or `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":45,"col":30},"end":{"line":45,"col":38}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`borrowed` describes a parameter, and this is the result.\n\nA result takes `fresh` (with `exclusive`), `escaped` or `unknown`. To say that\nthe result is one of the parameters, write `returned` in front of that\nparameter."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":48,"col":35},"end":{"line":48,"col":43}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":51,"col":34},"end":{"line":51,"col":42}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":54,"col":33},"end":{"line":54,"col":41}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `returned` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":57,"col":24},"end":{"line":57,"col":32}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `consumed` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":60,"col":32},"end":{"line":60,"col":36}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `many` cannot hold together with another word written here.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":63,"col":27},"end":{"line":63,"col":32}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `owned` cannot hold together with another word written here.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":66,"col":46},"end":{"line":66,"col":53}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `unknown` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":69,"col":35},"end":{"line":69,"col":44}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `exclusive` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA position takes each word once; `unused` and `borrowed` stand alone; a value\nis `aliased` or `returned`, not both; a function is called `once` or `many`,\nand `owned` needs one of them; a result is one of `fresh`, `escaped` and\n`unknown`, and `exclusive` needs `fresh`; a function is never `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":72,"col":29},"end":{"line":72,"col":37}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `borrowed` is inside a type.\n\nA word describes a whole parameter or the whole result, so it stands in front\nof a parameter of the signature's arrow or in front of its result:\n`join : borrowed List String, String → String`. Move it there, or remove it."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":82,"col":30},"end":{"line":82,"col":34}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`many` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":85,"col":29},"end":{"line":85,"col":33}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`many` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":97,"col":35},"end":{"line":97,"col":42}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`written` describes a parameter, and this is the result.\n\nA result takes `fresh` (with `exclusive`), `escaped` or `unknown`. To say that\nthe result is one of the parameters, write `returned` in front of that\nparameter."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":100,"col":27},"end":{"line":100,"col":31}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`lent` describes a result, and this is a parameter.\n\n`fresh`, `exclusive` and `unknown` say what a call returns, so they stand in\nfront of the type after the last `→`. A parameter takes `unused`, `borrowed`,\n`aliased`, `returned`, `escaped` or `consumed`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":103,"col":30},"end":{"line":103,"col":35}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`taken` describes a function parameter, and this parameter's type is not a\nfunction written out.\n\n`once`, `many` and `owned` say how often a function parameter is called and\nwhat it is handed. Write the function type in the signature, as in\n`once (⊤ → a)`, or use a word for a value: `borrowed`, `aliased`, `returned`,\n`escaped`, `consumed` or `unused`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":106,"col":30},"end":{"line":106,"col":39}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellwrite` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":106,"col":47},"end":{"line":106,"col":57}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellupdate` describes a callback that runs between a read and a write of a\ncell, and this function type is not marked `sync`.\n\nNo other fiber may run while the callback holds the cell's contents. Mark the\nfunction type itself: `cellupdate sync (a → a)`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":109,"col":37},"end":{"line":109,"col":45}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellread` stands in front of the wrong parameter.\n\nA cell operation names its cell first: `cellread`, `cellwrite` and\n`cellcomplete` go in front of the first parameter. What the operation stores,\nor the callback it runs, comes second: `cellstored`, `cellupdate` and\n`cellmodify` go in front of the second parameter."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":112,"col":39},"end":{"line":112,"col":46}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellnew` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":115,"col":40},"end":{"line":115,"col":49}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `cellwrite` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA result is one of `fresh`, `escaped`, `unknown`, `taken`, `lent`,\n`lentoptional`, `cellnew`, `cellempty`, `builderdone` and `concatenated`. A\nparameter does one thing to a cell: `cellread`, `cellwrite` or `cellcomplete`.\n`cellupdate` and `cellmodify` say already that the callback is called once and\nis handed the contents owned, so they stand without `once`, `many`, `taken`,\n`owned` and each other."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":115,"col":66},"end":{"line":115,"col":76}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellstored` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":118,"col":67},"end":{"line":118,"col":78}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `builderdone` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA result is one of `fresh`, `escaped`, `unknown`, `taken`, `lent`,\n`lentoptional`, `cellnew`, `cellempty`, `builderdone` and `concatenated`. A\nparameter does one thing to a cell: `cellread`, `cellwrite` or `cellcomplete`.\n`cellupdate` and `cellmodify` say already that the callback is called once and\nis handed the contents owned, so they stand without `once`, `many`, `taken`,\n`owned` and each other."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":121,"col":32},"end":{"line":121,"col":41}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cellwrite` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":121,"col":54},"end":{"line":121,"col":64}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"The ownership word `cellupdate` cannot hold together with another word written\nhere.\n\nA result is one of `fresh`, `escaped`, `unknown`, `taken`, `lent`,\n`lentoptional`, `cellnew`, `cellempty`, `builderdone` and `concatenated`. A\nparameter does one thing to a cell: `cellread`, `cellwrite` or `cellcomplete`.\n`cellupdate` and `cellmodify` say already that the callback is called once and\nis handed the contents owned, so they stand without `once`, `many`, `taken`,\n`owned` and each other."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":129,"col":5},"end":{"line":129,"col":13}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`sequence` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":132,"col":12},"end":{"line":132,"col":16}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cell` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":136,"col":1},"end":{"line":136,"col":5}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`cell` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":140,"col":5},"end":{"line":140,"col":11}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`sender` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":144,"col":5},"end":{"line":144,"col":13}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`sequence` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":148,"col":1},"end":{"line":148,"col":9}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`sequence` cannot stand in front of this declaration.\n\n`sequence` stands before the `foreign type` of a type with one parameter:\n`sequence foreign type Builder a`. `cell` stands before an opaque type, or a\n`foreign type`, with one parameter: `pub opaque cell type Ref a = Ref Js.Value`.\n`sender` stands before an alias of a function of one argument that returns\n`⊤`: `pub sender type alias Send msg = msg → ⊤`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":153,"col":7},"end":{"line":153,"col":14}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`failure` marks the failure constructor of a type with two constructors, and it\ncannot stand here.\n\nThe type has exactly two constructors, each with one argument, and `failure`\nstands before one of them: `type Result e a = Ok a | failure Err e`."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":162,"col":42},"end":{"line":162,"col":47}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`taken` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":165,"col":27},"end":{"line":165,"col":32}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`taken` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/MisplacedOwnershipWord.beni","start":{"line":168,"col":81},"end":{"line":168,"col":93}},"title":"MISPLACED OWNERSHIP WORD","message":"`concatenated` needs another word beside it, and that word is missing.\n\nThese words name the roles of several parameters together: `cellnew` needs a\n`consumed` first parameter, `cellempty` an `unused` one, `lent` and\n`lentoptional` a `cellread` one; `cellwrite` needs a second parameter that is\n`cellstored`, `cellupdate` or `cellmodify`, and `cellcomplete` one that is\n`cellstored`; `cellstored` is `consumed` and follows `cellwrite` or\n`cellcomplete`; `builderdone` needs a `written returned` first parameter and a\nsecond, its length, at most `borrowed`; `concatenated` a `written` first\nparameter and exactly one more; a `taken` result or function parameter a\ncontainer before it that is not `unused`. Write the missing word, or remove\nthis one."},{"code":"misplaced_ownership_word","severity":"error","span":{"file":"tests/corpus/check/bad/core/Mi